+Fix a sample point \(\omega\) and a deterministic time \(t\).  If
+\((t:\overline{\kappa})<\tau(\omega)\), then the stopped/indicator process
+\[
+  Z_s(\omega)
+  =
+  \mathbf 1_{\{\bot<\tau(\omega)\}}M_{s\wedge\tau(\omega)}(\omega)
